{"availability":"available","full":"travisjneuman/neumanos","name":"neumanos","description":"Privacy-first, local-only personal OS — calendar, notes, kanban, spreadsheets, AI terminal, and 30+ widgets. All data stays on your device. React 19 + TypeScript + IndexedDB.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":32,"forks":9,"created":"2026-02-19T04:32:51Z","updated":"2026-10-05T02:58:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://os.neuman.dev","topics":["ai-terminal","calendar","dashboard","dexie","indexeddb","kanban","local-first","neumanos","notes-app","offline-first","open-source","privacy-first","productivity","pwa","react","spreadsheet","tailwindcss","typescript","vite","zustand"],"demo":"https://os.neuman.dev/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.100Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.100Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.100Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.100Z","stars":32,"forks":9}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A privacy-first, local-only platform for organizing your life and work without surrendering your data.","Live Site | Documentation | Report Bug | Request Feature","NeumanOS is an all-in-one productivity platform that lives entirely on your device. Notes, tasks, time tracking, calendar, documents, diagrams, forms, bookmarks, and an AI terminal, all in one app, with no account required and no data leaving your machine unless you connect an AI provider or a live-data widget."],"features":["Rich text editing, full markdown support, and wiki-style [[links]] between notes. A D3 force-directed graph view reveals the connections in your knowledge base. Daily notes, nested tags, slash commands, and full-text…","Kanban boards with drag-and-drop columns, custom workflow stages, task dependencies (4 types with lag time), subtasks, priority levels, recurring tasks, and a Gantt timeline view with critical path highlighting. A PM…","Daily habit tracking with streaks and heatmaps, spaced repetition flashcards using the SM-2 algorithm, daily quests with XP and rewards, a routine builder, and journal integration. Routines and goals live alongside your…","A persistent sidebar timer stays with you across the app. Log hours by project, review daily and weekly summaries, generate monthly reports with heat maps, and export to CSV for invoicing. Manual entry and bulk…","Month, week, day, and agenda views with drag-and-drop rescheduling. Recurring events, browser reminders, conflict detection, and two-way ICS import/export for compatibility with Google Calendar and Apple Calendar. Task…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/travisjneuman/neumanos/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2fabf32867680126206efbdea799b9fa8750aa9bfb1ca3a0f5771ef11267b18b","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.435Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.435Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A privacy-first, local-only platform for organizing your life and work without surrendering your data.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/travisjneuman/neumanos/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Notes, tasks, time tracking, calendar, documents, diagrams, forms, bookmarks, and an AI terminal, all in one app, with no account required and no data leaving your machine unless you connect an AI provider or a live-data widget.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/travisjneuman/neumanos/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No account required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/travisjneuman/neumanos/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2fabf32867680126206efbdea799b9fa8750aa9bfb1ca3a0f5771ef11267b18b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/travisjneuman/neumanos/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.436Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T02:58:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/travisjneuman